{"id":57,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"سَبَّحَ لِلَّهِ مَا فِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ‌ۖ وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> مُلْكُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ‌ۖ يُحْى<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> وَيُمِيتُ‌ۖ وَهُوَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ ش<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">َىْءٍ ق</span>َد<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"هُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَوَّلُ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَخِرُ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ظَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هِرُ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبَاطِنُ‌ۖ وَهُوَ بِكُلِّ شَىْءٍ عَل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"هُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى خَلَقَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضَ فِى سِتَّةِ أَيَّا<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">مٍ ث</span>ُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتَوَىٰ عَلَى <