اْ</span> مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا جَعَلَك<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ُّسْتَخْلَفِينَ فِيهِ‌ۖ فَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نك</span>ُمْ وَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>َقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لَهُمْ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">جْ</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">رٌ ك</span>َب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧</span>"},{"id":8,"tajweed":"وَمَا لَكُمْ لَا تُؤْمِنُونَ بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ‌ۙ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رَّسُولُ يَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>عُوكُمْ لِتُؤْمِنُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> بِرَبِّكُمْ وَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> أَخَذَ مِيثَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>قَكُمْ إِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ك</span>ُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ُّؤْمِن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨</span>"},{"id":9,"tajweed":"هُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى يُنَزِّلُ عَلَىٰ عَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>دِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِۦٓ</span> ءَايَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">تِۭ ب</span>َيِّنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">تٍ ل</span>ِّيُخْرِجَك<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ظُّلُمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِ إِلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>ُورِ‌ۚ وَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ بِكُمْ لَرَءُو<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">فٌ ر</span>َّح<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٩</span>"},{"id":10,"tajweed":"وَمَا لَكُمْ أَلَّا تُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>ِقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> فِى سَبِيلِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ وَلِلَّهِ مِير<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>ثُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ‌ۚ لَا يَسْتَوِى مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نك</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>َّنْ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>َقَ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْفَتْحِ وَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تَلَ‌ۚ أُ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">وْ</span>لَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>ئِكَ أَعْظَمُ دَرَجَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةً م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>َقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> م<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">ِنۢ ب</span>َعْدُ وَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تَلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ‌ۚ</span> وَكُل<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">اًّ و</span>َعَدَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحُسْنَىٰ‌ۚ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ خَب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٠</span>"},{"id":11,"tajweed":"مَّ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ذ</span>َا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى يُ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>رِضُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ قَرْضًا حَسَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نًا ف</span>َيُضَ<span class=\"t