ass=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٌ و</span>َلَا مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ‌ۚ</span> مَأْوَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ىٰ</span>كُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َارُ‌ۖ هِىَ مَوْلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>كُمْ‌ۖ وَبِئْسَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَص<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>رُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٥</span>"},{"id":16,"tajweed":"۞ أَلَمْ يَأْنِ لِلَّذِينَ ءَامَن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>َخْشَعَ قُلُوبُهُمْ لِذِكْرِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ وَمَا نَزَلَ مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقِّ وَلَا يَكُونُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> كَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ أُوتُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكِتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>بَ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ق</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>لُ فَطَالَ عَلَيْهِمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَمَدُ فَقَسَتْ قُلُوبُهُمْ‌ۖ وَكَثِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌ م</span>ِّنْهُمْ فَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>سِق<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٦</span>"},{"id":17,"tajweed":"ٱعْلَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ُوٓ</span><span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهَ يُحْىِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضَ بَعْدَ مَوْتِهَا‌ۚ قَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> بَيَّ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َا لَكُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَيَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِ لَعَلَّكُمْ تَعْقِل<span class=\"tj tj-madda_p